# skill-references.manifest
#
# Which repo-root / docs/ files get bundled into which skill's references/
# directory at install time. The `skills` npm CLI only ships files that
# live inside an individual skill directory, so anything a skill needs to
# read at runtime must be mirrored here and synced via
# scripts/sync-skill-references.sh.
#
# Format: one entry per line, whitespace-separated:
#     <source-path-relative-to-repo-root>  <consuming-skill-directory>
# Lines beginning with `#` and blank lines are ignored.

SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              help
SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              correct-course
SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              setup-ralph-loop
SYSTEM-OVERVIEW.md              improve-pipeline
docs/writing-for-humans.md      pre-merge
docs/writing-for-humans.md      triage-issue
docs/writing-for-humans.md      prd-to-issues
docs/writing-for-humans.md      qa
docs/writing-for-humans.md      improve-pipeline
docs/writing-for-humans.md      handoff
docs/writing-for-humans.md      visual-recap
docs/writing-for-humans.md      walk-commits
docs/destination-check.md       qa
docs/destination-check.md       triage-issue
docs/skill-anatomy.md           improve-pipeline
docs/using-this-pack.md         help
docs/next-step-menu.md          execute
docs/next-step-menu.md          pre-merge
docs/next-step-menu.md          shape
docs/next-step-menu.md          closeout
docs/next-step-menu.md          visual-recap
docs/next-step-menu.md          walk-commits
docs/visual-rendering-core.md   visual-recap
docs/visual-rendering-core.md   walk-commits
docs/visual-recap-design.md     visual-recap
docs/visual-recap-design.md     walk-commits
docs/restated-claims.md         tdd
docs/restated-claims.md         pre-merge
docs/restated-claims.md         execute
docs/escaped-defect-join.md   improve-pipeline
